    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's cool. but if you had to rank them, which ones do you think actually had the most direct influence on the way things look today? like, if we didn't have the european renaissance or the roman legal systems, would modern science and law even exist in the way they do, or were the other cultures just supporting players?",
